```
trait ConsistentHashable {
  def consistentHashKey: Any
}

case class ConsistentHashableEnvelope(message: Any, hashKey: Any)
  extends ConsistentHashable with RouterEnvelope {
  override def consistentHashKey: Any = hashKey
}
```

The reason, once again, is that implementation of ConsistentHashable goes into user code, and hashKey is not unique enough to avoid confusion and also possible naming conflicts.

